# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# The Capacitor wrap at sahayakai-android/mobile/android/ names its credentials
# file `keystore.properties`, not `key.properties`. This app reuses that
# project's upload keystore (same applicationId), so copying that file across is
# the likely path — and none of the template patterns above would have caught
# it. Unanchored, so it matches at any depth under android/.
keystore.properties
